  "caption": "席勒狂野扭曲的筆觸這次不是在人物上 而是在奧地利山丘上的城堡 濃烈的天空 奔放的色彩 沿著山巒流動至百年後的世界 畫面依然鮮活真實 \n\nThis time, Schiele’s wild, distorted brushstrokes are not on human figures, but across a castle perched on the hills of Austria.\n\nA dramatic sky, vivid colours flowing across the hills, bringing his vision to life more than a century later.\n\nEven after all these years, the painting feels as vivid and alive as ever.",
